-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">請於到貨當日完成檢查，若有問題請於當日晚上10點前回報</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">逾時一律視同商品無問題</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">（五）保健食品文案範例</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">保健食品文案要特別保守，適合從「日常補充、成分資訊、食用方式、規格清楚」切入，不要寫療效或改善疾病。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">範例：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">日常營養補充錠</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">售價399元/盒</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">平常想做日常營養補充的人，可以先從成分、規格和食用方式看起。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">小包裝攜帶方便，上班、外出或日常固定補充都比較好安排。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">這類商品重點是看清楚標示，依照建議方式食用，不要自行過量。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">適合平常有補充習慣，想找固定日常保養品項的人參考。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">規格：每盒30錠</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">食用方式：請依商品標示建議方式食用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">保存方式：請放置陰涼乾燥處，避免陽光直射。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">注意事項：孕婦、哺乳中、特殊體質或正在使用藥物者，食用前請先諮詢專業醫師或藥師。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">本品為一般食品，非醫療用品，文案不得宣稱療效、改善疾病或保證效果。</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">六、團購商品賣點常見問題 Q&amp;A</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Q1：商品本身很普通，還適合開團嗎？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">可以，但要看商品是否符合客人的日常需求。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">普通商品不代表不好賣，有些日用品、食品、清潔用品本來就是因為消耗快、需求穩定、價格合理，才適合反覆開團。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">團購主可以從補貨需求、回購機會與價格感來判斷是否值得測試。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Q2：同一個商品，不同客群賣點會一樣嗎？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">不一定。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">同一款冷凍食品，對上班族來說，賣點可能是快速方便；對家庭客來說，可能是加菜容易；對團購主來說，可能是保存方便、出貨穩定、回購機會高。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">所以團購主在寫文案前，要先確認這次主要想賣給哪一類客人。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Q3：商品賣點要放在貼文哪個位置？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">建議放在貼文前段。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">社群貼文的瀏覽速度快，客人通常會先看開頭幾行，再決定要不要繼續看。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">開頭可以先放最有感的情境、痛點或主要賣點，後面再補商品規格、價格、保存方式、注意事項與下單資訊。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Q4：商品文案可以直接使用 AI 生成嗎？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">可以使用 AI 協助整理方向，但不能完全不檢查就發布。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">AI 生成後仍然要確認商品資訊、規格、價格、效期、保存方式、法規用語與廠商提供資料是否一致，尤其食品、保健品與特殊商品更要注意。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Q5：怎麼判斷一個商品有沒有回購機會？</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">可以從消耗頻率、使用門檻、價格接受度與客人收到後的滿意度來判斷。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">例如食品、零食、冷凍商品、清潔用品與日常消耗品，通常比較有機會形成回購。若商品品質穩定、價格合理、客人使用後反應不錯，後續就比較適合再次開團。</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; color: #0f4761; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">七、結語</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">團購商品怎麼賣，重點不只是商品本身好不好，而是團購主能不能幫客人找到下單理由。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">整理商品賣點時，可以先思考這個商品適合誰、客人為什麼需要、下單前會擔心什麼，以及商品是否有回購或補貨機會。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">當商品特色能轉換成客人看得懂的好處，開團文案就不只是介紹商品，而是幫助客人快速判斷這項商品是否適合自己。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'MS Mincho\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><br></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'微軟正黑體\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">想找到更多適合開團的商品，也想減少自己整理商品資訊、圖片與文案的時間？歡迎進一步認識麥易購團購平台。</span></p>',' ',' ',' ',' ',' ',' ',' ',0,'2026/07/15','2099/12/31','tw','news','麥易購團購網','index , follow','7','麥易購股份有限公司','團購商品怎麼賣？團購主找商品賣點、寫開團文案的完整指南','麥易購股份有限公司','<meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"EOOrY5_jUflBRZxrlNaxByoanGg8XkgNU7jt0vpdmc4\" />\r\n\r\n<!-- Google tag (gtag.js) -->\r\n<script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-VSELZ4BKVQ\"></script>\r\n<script>\r\n  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\r\n  function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\r\n  gtag(\'js\', new Date());\r\n\r\n  gtag(\'config\', \'G-VSELZ4BKVQ\');\r\n</script>','','2026/07/15 09:44:23','admin','2026/07/15 10:43:00','admin');
